{#
contacts/_pane_actions.html.twig — the end of a contacts page's header, when the
page is in the pane docked beside the mail: the way out to the same page full
size, and the way to close the pane. Nothing on the full page.

Included, so it reads `inPane` and `iconBtn` from contacts/_layout.html.twig.

The way out goes to the address this page was asked for, `_top`, so a contact
open here is the one open there. A page rendered WITH the mailbox has no
address of its own (it is a sub-request) and goes to the list.
#}
{% if inPane %}
    {% set pageUrl = true == app.request.attributes.get('_contacts_pane')
        ? path('app_contacts_list')
        : app.request.requestUri %}
    <span class="flex items-center gap-0.5 -mr-2" data-contacts-pane-actions>
        <a href="{{ pageUrl }}"
           data-turbo-frame="_top"
           class="{{ iconBtn }}"
           aria-label="{{ 'contacts.pane.open_page'|trans }}"
           title="{{ 'contacts.pane.open_page'|trans }}">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-and-down-left-from-center text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </a>
        <button type="button"
                data-action="contacts--pane#close"
                class="{{ iconBtn }}"
                aria-label="{{ 'contacts.pane.close'|trans }}"
                title="{{ 'contacts.pane.close'|trans }}">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-sm" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
    </span>
{% endif %}
